From a7df70f9b858021ad4c46b037bce9c11fb3d7a28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:10:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Don't migrate fullscreen windows between layers

Active fullscreen windows were moved above docks, so panels could not be
revealed over them even with the screen edge set to stay active. Keep
them in their layer, unblock panel edges and drop the slide workaround.

BUG: 426840
